  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "90290a0f-39b0-48ea-94f3-1f6cbdc14b01"],
 " count returns one representative. An integer count requests exactly that \
many distinct representatives and returns ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "491f8e4a-445c-46c6-9158-6fbdadeac838"],
 " when too few exist."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"2a481cf4-a2ba-4a3e-8f60-f3501060ead6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\"\<NextVertexFunction\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "Identity"}]], 
